 * @example
 * ```typescript
 * const signatures = await forwarder.forwardSequentially([
 *   createAccountTx,
 *   depositTx,
 * ]);
 * console.log(`Account created: ${signatures[0]}`);
 * console.log(`Deposit landed: ${signatures[1]}`);
 * ```
